# Per-tenant demo MCP secrets. These files hold the shared JWT_SECRET, the
# MCP_API_KEY, embedding/LLM keys and bucket credentials — never commit them.
# (acme-power / acme-cement / bihar-gov were committed before this rule; see
# docs/acme-bank-demo-plan.md. Untracking them does NOT scrub git history, so
# those values need rotating.)
demo-data/tenants/*/mcp/.env

# Generated demo claim documents — rebuilt by generate_claim_documents.py
